}
Keep the `consignment_id` and `tracking_code`. They are how you ask about this parcel later.
A rejected field comes back as `{"status": 400, "errors": { ... }}` with the field names — the parcel is not booked.
Every parcel starts `in_review` and is approved by us shortly after.
`exchange` in the response says how the parcel was booked. Any value other than true or false is refused with the other field errors.
